</section>

<section id="masteries">
  <h2 class="serif"><span class="num">09</span>Masteries</h2>
  <p class="sub">Twelve passive specializations per class. Beyond the numbers, several add a <b>new trigger</b> — and that's where builds are born.</p>

  <div class="grid g2">
